       "reasons": [
        {
         "@type": "meaningComprehension",
         "comprehends": [
          "copies/bd915bs0646.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil, treble edge, at the tail of the roll. Five small figures, about 27 px each, cut along the top by the crop edge. The last two are secure: the 2 matches the 2 of the roll number written at the head of the roll (crop 4) and the 1 is a plain stroke, so the year is 21. My best reading of the rest is 30 and 8, giving 30 August, but the first figure could be a 2 (day 20) and the third could be a 6 (June), so I have left date_iso at the year alone rather than complete it. Crop 2 carries a short pencil tick, crop 3 creases, crop 5 the leader join."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
